The official release archive is unmodified and retains third-party notices in
packages/ and public/packages/. The local shell/Python launchers and router
configure SQLite and storage under DATA_DIR, choose the upstream offline demo
barcode lookup, initialize the application through its normal entrypoint, and
start PHP's web server. Printer features remain disabled.

The bundled PHP CLI 8.5.12 was built from the unmodified official source:
https://www.php.net/distributions/php-8.5.12.tar.xz
It is distributed under PHP-3.01 with Ubuntu 24.04 shared libraries. The runtime
retains its notices in php/share/licenses; copies are available in LICENSES/.
SOURCE.json records the PHP configure options and source input. Ubuntu library
source packages are available at https://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/; retrieve
the matching source package with apt-get source on Ubuntu 24.04.

The environment also builds libfaketime 0.9.12, separately preloaded to provide
the application clock. It is GPL-2.0-only; the full text is LICENSES/libfaketime.txt.
Unmodified corresponding source and build files:
https://github.com/wolfcw/libfaketime/archive/refs/tags/v0.9.12.tar.gz
The environment Dockerfile fixes that source checksum and builds its library.
